616
01:00:50,233 --> 01:00:51,275
Olá?

617
01:00:59,233 --> 01:01:00,275
Olá?

618
01:02:00,441 --> 01:02:01,441
O que é isto?

619
01:02:03,858 --> 01:02:05,066
Toda uma vida.

620
01:03:14,983 --> 01:03:16,233
